// Heat waves
// In this script, I calculate heat wave index.
// I use the definition of "A 5-d heatwave with a 90th percentile threshold is defined as five consecutive 
// days with the maximum temperature exceeding the 90th percentile of the long-term climatology for that month"
// from Mazdiyasni & AghaKouchak 2015
// https://www.pnas.org/doi/full/10.1073/pnas.1422945112

//Date- 22nd Jan 2025
////////////////////////////////////1.EDA
